			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="53" left="36" top="478.5" width="109.5" height="15.75" align-x="56.25" align-y="491.25" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
				<p style="Heading 2" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Transition JUMP</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="12607" left="0" top="497.25" width="6008.25" align-x="0" align-y="497.25" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="" height="1292.25">
			<area is-collapsed="true" name="" show-name="false" show-border="true" show-icon="true" show-timestamp="true" allow-expand="false" is-locked="false" timestamp="" top-lock-id="1593" bottom-lock-id="3723">
				<region region-id="12556" left="480" top="10.5" width="244.5" height="132" align-x="489" align-y="20.25" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
					<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
						<p style="Обычный" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Here is a 4 different states of longitudinal </p>
						<p style="Обычный" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">optics based on <b>transition energy</b>:</p>
						<p style="Обычный" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">1) acceleration from injection energy with initial value;</p>
						<p style="Обычный" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">2) smooth increase to peak<sp count="2"/>
						</p>
						<p style="Обычный" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="0" text-align="left" list-style-type="none" tabs="inherit">3) jump</p>
						<p style="Обычный" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">4) initial value till the experiment energy</p>
						<p style="Обычный" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit"/>
						<p style="Обычный" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">1.First defines 3) state based on the maximum availiable</p>
						<p style="Обычный" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">speed of transition shift and availiable transition size</p>
						<p style="Обычный" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="0" text-align="left" list-style-type="none" tabs="inherit">2.Secondly, we can understand states 3</p>
						<p style="Обычный" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="0" text-align="left" list-style-type="none" tabs="inherit">3.Finally, states 3 and 5 also can be understand</p>
					</text>
				</region>
				<region region-id="10912" left="24" top="17.25" width="50.25" height="15" align-x="50.25" align-y="26.25" show-border="false" show-highlight="true" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="#ffff80" tag="">
